  "qualification_notes": [
    "All six initial firmware/web upgrades passed 13/10 checks each. Final web reports on four boards timed out during the PC HTTP verification after successful on-device installation; follow-up verified installed versions and exact served client/file sources on all six.",
    "The original helper queried the wrong HTTP diagnostics component; it was corrected to blip.oscquery and all six directory trials reran successfully. One overlapping Ball helper was rejected by the serial port; final trials used exclusive serial ownership.",
    "Browser failures included ERR_NETWORK_CHANGED, truncated responses, unread short mutation responses, and a helper that did not follow pagination after fixture folders accumulated. Final helper follows pages and records bounded read-only startup reloads. Earlier failed reports are retained.",
    "Ball serial capture includes send errno 11 and socket resets. The final 32 KiB browser flow passed with bounded read recovery; this is not uninterrupted-transfer, no-reconnect, sustained-RAM or large-media performance qualification.",
    "Payloads from failed cleanups were reclaimed through the common API and all passive fixture modules were unloaded. Empty test folders remain. Validated firmware/interface images remain installed."
  ],
